== Trivia ==
* The trinket is a direct reference to the item of the same name in The Binding of Isaac: Four Souls, which turns into another available item when used.
* In addition, the item is possibly a reference to the Self-forming Clay item from the rogue-like deckbuilder ''[[wikipedia:Slay the Spire|Slay the Spire]]''.

